# 2. Device Permissions

Our products may request permissions needed to provide their functionality.

Examples include camera, storage, browser access, downloads, or other device capabilities.

Permissions are used only for the functionality they provide. Data accessed through these permissions is processed locally on your device unless a specific feature described in this Privacy Policy requires communication with another service.

Ceibo Apps does not collect or transmit data accessed through these permissions for advertising, analytics, tracking, or profiling.

