# 5. Third-Party Services

## Google Play and Google Services

Android applications may use Google Play and Google services for functionality provided by Android or Google Play, including application distribution, purchases, billing, reviews, and related functionality.

Google independently operates these services.

Google may collect and process information under its own privacy policies, including information related to payments, fraud prevention, security, legal compliance, and Google Play.

**Ceibo Apps does not control information that Google independently collects or processes.**

For more information:

* [Google Privacy Policy](https://policies.google.com/privacy)
* [Google Play & Google Payments Privacy Notices](https://payments.google.com/payments/apis-secure/u/0/get_legal_document?ldo=0&ldt=privacynotice)

## Polar

Minimal Save Image uses Polar only for Pro license purchasing, activation, and validation.

The extension sends the license key and an opaque activation ID to Polar's API for license-related functionality.

Payment information is handled by Polar and its payment providers. Ceibo Apps does not receive or store payment card information.

See [Polar's Privacy Policy](https://polar.sh/legal/privacy).

## No Advertising or Analytics

Ceibo Apps products do not use:

* Advertising networks
* Analytics providers
* Tracking services
* Affiliate redirects
* Advertising SDKs
* Remote advertising scripts
* Remotely hosted code for core functionality

